            </p>

            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div className="bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-slate-600">
                <p className="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-1">Affirmation</p>
